@page "/about"

<PageTitle>Smart-X · About</PageTitle>

<div class="smartx-about">
    <section class="sx-hero">
        <div class="sx-hero-copy">
            <span class="sx-eyebrow"><span class="sx-live-dot"></span> INTELLIGENCE AT THE EDGE</span>
            <h1>A smarter way to connect the <span class="sx-gradient">physical world.</span></h1>
            <p class="sx-lead">
                Smart-X is a hybrid Internet of Things ecosystem designed to monitor and manage
                distributed environments — from hydroponic farms to smart utilities and energy infrastructure.
            </p>
            <div class="sx-tags">
                <span>Internet of Things</span>
                <span>Edge Computing</span>
                <span>Automation</span>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="sx-network" aria-label="Illustration of connected Smart-X devices">
            <div class="sx-orbit sx-orbit-a"></div>
            <div class="sx-orbit sx-orbit-b"></div>
            <div class="sx-orbit sx-orbit-c"></div>
            <div class="sx-link sx-link-a"></div>
            <div class="sx-link sx-link-b"></div>
            <div class="sx-link sx-link-c"></div>
            <div class="sx-link sx-link-d"></div>

            <div class="sx-device sx-device-a">
                <span class="sx-device-icon">⌁</span>
                <small>ENVIRONMENT</small>
                <strong>24.8°</strong>
            </div>
            <div class="sx-device sx-device-b">
                <span class="sx-device-icon">ϟ</span>
                <small>POWER</small>
                <strong>1.42 kW</strong>
            </div>
            <div class="sx-device sx-device-c">
                <span class="sx-device-icon">◉</span>
                <small>ACTUATOR</small>
                <strong>CONNECTED</strong>
            </div>

            <div class="sx-gateway">
                <div class="sx-gateway-core">S<span>·</span>X</div>
                <small>SMART-X GATEWAY</small>
            </div>
            <div class="sx-network-caption">CONNECTED DEVICES <span>↔</span> SHARED INTELLIGENCE</div>
        </div>

        <span class="sx-hero-index">01 / ABOUT SMART-X</span>
    </section>

    <section class="sx-intro sx-section">
        <div class="sx-section-label">
            <span class="sx-number">01</span>
            <span>OUR PERSPECTIVE</span>
        </div>
        <div class="sx-intro-content">
            <h2>The world is generating data. <span>Smart-X helps make sense of it.</span></h2>
            <p>
                Across modern farms, buildings and energy infrastructure, thousands of small devices
                continuously measure what is happening in the real world. But raw readings alone are
                not enough. They need a reliable way to be collected, validated and managed.
            </p>
            <p>
                Smart-X brings distributed devices into one connected environment, giving operators a
                foundation for monitoring conditions and managing automated systems.
            </p>
        </div>
        <div class="sx-intro-visual" aria-hidden="true">
            <div class="sx-visual-ring ring-one"></div>
            <div class="sx-visual-ring ring-two"></div>
            <div class="sx-visual-grid"></div>
            <div class="sx-visual-chip">
                <span>ESP32</span>
                <strong>IoT</strong>
                <small>SENSOR NODE</small>
            </div>
            <span class="sx-visual-label">SIGNALS FROM THE PHYSICAL WORLD</span>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="sx-environments sx-section">
        <div class="sx-heading-row">
            <div>
                <span class="sx-eyebrow">BUILT FOR THE REAL WORLD</span>
                <h2>One ecosystem.<br /><span class="sx-gradient">Many environments.</span></h2>
            </div>
            <p>Different industries. Different signals. One connected approach to managing them.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="sx-environment-grid">
            <article class="sx-environment-card">
                <div class="sx-card-art sx-farm-art" aria-hidden="true">
                    <div class="sx-sun"></div>
                    <div class="sx-farm-row farm-row-a"></div>
                    <div class="sx-farm-row farm-row-b"></div>
                    <div class="sx-farm-row farm-row-c"></div>
                    <div class="sx-plant plant-a"><i></i><b></b></div>
                    <div class="sx-plant plant-b"><i></i><b></b></div>
                    <div class="sx-plant plant-c"><i></i><b></b></div>
                    <span class="sx-art-tag">01 / AGRICULTURE</span>
                </div>
                <div class="sx-card-content">
                    <span class="sx-card-kicker">AGRICULTURE</span>
                    <h3>Grow with greater awareness.</h3>
                    <p>Monitor conditions in hydroponic farms through environmental readings and automated irrigation states.</p>
                    <div class="sx-chip-row"><span>Moisture</span><span>Environment</span><span>Valves</span></div>
                </div>
            </article>

            <article class="sx-environment-card">
                <div class="sx-card-art sx-utility-art" aria-hidden="true">
                    <div class="sx-meter-halo"></div>
                    <div class="sx-meter">
                        <div class="sx-meter-screen">
                            <small>POWER</small>
                            <strong>1.42 <i>kW</i></strong>
                            <div class="sx-meter-bars"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="sx-meter-base"></div>
                    </div>
                    <span class="sx-art-tag">02 / SMART UTILITIES</span>
                </div>
                <div class="sx-card-content">
                    <span class="sx-card-kicker">SMART UTILITIES</span>
                    <h3>Understand every reading.</h3>
                    <p>Bring distributed utility trackers together to monitor power consumption and organise incoming measurements.</p>
                    <div class="sx-chip-row"><span>Power</span><span>Telemetry</span><span>Tracking</span></div>
                </div>
            </article>

            <article class="sx-environment-card">
                <div class="sx-card-art sx-grid-art" aria-hidden="true">
                    <div class="sx-grid-sun"></div>
                    <div class="sx-grid-building building-a"></div>
                    <div class="sx-grid-building building-b"></div>
                    <div class="sx-grid-building building-c"></div>
                    <div class="sx-tower"><i></i><b></b><em></em></div>
                    <div class="sx-wire wire-a"></div>
                    <div class="sx-wire wire-b"></div>
                    <span class="sx-art-tag">03 / ENERGY INFRASTRUCTURE</span>
                </div>
                <div class="sx-card-content">
                    <span class="sx-card-kicker">ENERGY INFRASTRUCTURE</span>
                    <h3>Connect a more responsive grid.</h3>
                    <p>Support smart grid installations with a central point for collecting readings and managing connected equipment.</p>
                    <div class="sx-chip-row"><span>Energy</span><span>Monitoring</span><span>Automation</span></div>
                </div>
            </article>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="sx-telemetry sx-section">
        <div class="sx-telemetry-copy">
            <span class="sx-eyebrow">FROM SIGNAL TO SYSTEM</span>
            <h2>Small devices.<br /><span class="sx-gradient">Big picture.</span></h2>
            <p>
                At the heart of Smart-X is a network of microcontrollers, including ESP32 devices,
                continuously publishing telemetry from distributed environments to a central gateway.
            </p>
            <p>
                The challenge is not simply receiving data. It is handling different data types and
                keeping the flow organised as devices report their states.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="sx-telemetry-panel">
            <div class="sx-panel-heading">
                <span>TELEMETRY STREAM</span>
                <span class="sx-data-status"><i></i> DATA TYPES</span>
            </div>
            <div class="sx-telemetry-row">
                <span class="sx-type-icon sx-float-icon">ƒ</span>
                <div><strong>Floating-point values</strong><small>Environmental measurements</small></div>
                <code>24.8</code>
            </div>
            <div class="sx-telemetry-row">
                <span class="sx-type-icon sx-int-icon">#</span>
                <div><strong>Integer values</strong><small>Power wattage</small></div>
                <code>1420</code>
            </div>
            <div class="sx-telemetry-row">
                <span class="sx-type-icon sx-bool-icon">↔</span>
                <div><strong>Boolean values</strong><small>Valve and actuator states</small></div>
                <code>true</code>
            </div>
            <div class="sx-stream-dots"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>
            <div class="sx-central-gateway">
                <span class="sx-mini-logo">S<span>·</span>X</span>
                <div><strong>Central Gateway</strong><small>One destination for distributed telemetry</small></div>
                <span class="sx-arrow">↗</span>
            </div>
            <div class="sx-steps"><span>01 / COLLECT</span><span>02 / VALIDATE</span><span>03 / MANAGE</span></div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="sx-principles sx-section">
        <div class="sx-principles-heading">
            <span class="sx-eyebrow">THE SMART-X APPROACH</span>
            <h2>Designed around<br />the flow of information.</h2>
            <p>Connected environments need more than data collection. They need a consistent way to bring signals together.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="sx-principles-list">
            <article class="sx-principle">
                <span>01</span>
                <div><h3>Distributed by nature</h3><p>Support devices spread across facilities, zones and connected environments.</p></div>
                <b>↗</b>
            </article>
            <article class="sx-principle">
                <span>02</span>
                <div><h3>Built for different signals</h3><p>Accommodate numerical measurements and on/off states in a multi-typed telemetry stream.</p></div>
                <b>↗</b>
            </article>
            <article class="sx-principle">
                <span>03</span>
                <div><h3>Connected through a gateway</h3><p>Bring incoming telemetry into a central system designed to process, validate and manage the flow.</p></div>
                <b>↗</b>
            </article>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="sx-closing">
        <div class="sx-closing-mark"><span class="sx-closing-orbit orbit-x"></span><span class="sx-closing-orbit orbit-y"></span><strong>S<span>·</span>X</strong></div>
        <div class="sx-closing-copy">
            <span class="sx-eyebrow">A MORE CONNECTED FUTURE</span>
            <h2>Many signals.<br /><span class="sx-gradient">One smarter system.</span></h2>
            <p>Smart-X brings connected devices and distributed environments into a unified IoT ecosystem — building a foundation for informed monitoring and automation.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="sx-closing-footer"><span>SMART-X / CONNECTED INTELLIGENCE</span><span>SOUTH AFRICA · BUILT FOR CONNECTION</span></div>
    </section>
</div>

<style>
    .smartx-about {
        --sx-bg: #101722;
        --sx-surface: #151f2c;
        --sx-surface-raised: #1b2937;
        --sx-text: #edf3f5;
        --sx-muted: #a4b2bd;
        --sx-line: rgba(178, 199, 211, .16);
        --sx-teal: #72e0c3;
        --sx-blue: #79a9ff;
        --sx-orange: #e99a66;
        width: 100%;
        max-width: none;
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
        border: 0;
        border-radius: 0;
        box-shadow: none;
        color: var(--sx-text);
        background: var(--sx-bg);
        font-family: inherit;
        overflow: hidden;
    }

        .smartx-about * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        .smartx-about h1, .smartx-about h2, .smartx-about h3, .smartx-about p {
            margin-top: 0;
        }

        .smartx-about .sx-eyebrow {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
            color: var(--sx-teal);
            font-size: .67rem;
            font-weight: 750;
            letter-spacing: .15em;
        }

        .smartx-about .sx-live-dot, .smartx-about .sx-data-status i {
            display: inline-block;
            width: 7px;
            height: 7px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: var(--sx-teal);
            box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px rgba(114,224,195,.12);
        }

        .smartx-about .sx-gradient {
            color: var(--sx-teal);
            background: linear-gradient(100deg, var(--sx-teal), var(--sx-blue));
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
        }

    .sx-hero {
